{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1263973-beasts-not-cod-related","id":1263973,"title":"Beasts(not COD related)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-10-31T21:48:08-07:00","id":1263973,"title":"Beasts(not COD related)","content":"So I was watching the Chrono Trigger Musical and was all &quot;man I'd love to play Frog as a changeling.. but he's so not pooka&quot; So it occurred to me there is sort of a certain amount of prescedent in myth of people being cursed with awesome Beast powers.. see you know the Beast from Beauty and..<br /> <br /> So I wonder if there's room between something like a Kith and fullbown Dautain status for something like Frog or the Beast, someone who might have their very fairy Soul cursed without being full on Dautain...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-01T08:29:19-07:00","id":1264052,"title":"","content":"Spitballing here \u2014 a loose interpretation of Geas might get you there. Metamorphosis plus some Time would probably be better though. You could use Metamorphosis to give someone a donkey head and use the Time Realm to set the duration to be when they stop acting like an ass.<br /> <br /> For a more general non-cursed, animalistic changeling that's not a pooka, the kith creation guidelines might be helpful. You could look at the Beast kiths from Lost for ideas.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Charlie Cantrell</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer <hr />Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition, Conquering Heroes, Book of Freeholds, Guide to the Night, C20 Players Guide","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","name":"PookaKnight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"690"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-01T10:27:12-07:00","id":1264070,"title":"","content":"I have no problem getting there. I was thinking about how making it a central idea might be.. like your kith is &quot;Being cursed&quot; and then your arc is gaining control/fixing it but I'm not sure if that works as a kith, or if being cursed down through your lives falls into Dautain status...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-01T19:13:12-07:00","id":1264183,"title":"","content":"<b>The Accursed </b> (I know the name needs work, but couldn\u2019t remember any suitable fairy type at the moment)<br /> <br /> <b>Birthrights</b><br /> \u2022 Form of the Beast: The Accursed are bestial forces of nature each one different from another the curse twisting them according to their nature. Some become huge bear like brutes while others are much more lithe serpents. Their bestial forms give them +2 points to spend amongst physical attributes as they please. These dots may bring the Attribute over five dots and even when they do not they raise said Attributes maximum rating with the same amount.<br /> <br /> \u2022 Wrath of the Beast: The Accursed are cursed to be horrible dangerous beasts as suits their nature and as such their bestial forms are always dangerous. Many of the Accursed are monstrous amalgams of bestial features including horns, claws and mouths filled with ficious sharp teeth giving them natural weapons that deal +1 lethal damage. Their fury can bolster these horrid features further and by spending 1 Glamour these natural weapons grow wickedly sharp and blackened by nightmarish hatred allowing the Accursed to inflict Aggravated damage through their attacks.<br /> <br /> <b>Frailty</b><br /> The Curse: The Accursed are afflicted by a horrid curse that not only twists their bodies into bestial mockeries but also drives their minds into a world of animalistic passions and instincts. The Accursed are volative and dangerous beasts quickly angered and untamable, their have some difficulty hiding their emotions and tend to react to things through instinct before thinking. This gives them +2 difficulty in most social situations where such bestial behaviour would be frowned upon and forces one to roll Wits (diff.6) when surprised in any manner to not react with hostile action, usually an attack, towards the source of the surprise. <br /> <br /> The Curse always has some caveat to life it from one of the Accursed. This varies vildly from individual to individual but the most common set of caveat within the Kith is a matter of Courts. Most Accursed are Unseelie and can only lift the Curse by becoming Seelie and are again struck by their Curse if they ever slip back to their Unseelie ways, though there are cases where the Curse strikes when becoming Seelie and lifts when returning to proper Unseelie ways. And there are cases where the conditions have nothing to do with the Courts such as the famous case of the Curse lifting if the Accursed can win anothers love despite their Curse and being Cursed again should the love be lost or tarnished.<br /> <br /> When the Curse is lifted the Accursed swich their Form of the Beast Birthright into Princely/Princessly Glory and their Wrath of the Beast Birthright into Handsome/Beautiful Attraction. The Curse itself is lifted giving them the Frailty Inspire the Jealous Heart.<br /> <br /> \u2022 Princely/Princessly Glory: The formerly Accursed gains +2 Attribute dots to distribute amongst their Social Attributes, while loosing their physical bonuses from Form of the Beast, which allow said Attributes to go over 5 dots.<br /> <br /> \u2022Handsome/Beautiful Attraction: The formerly Accursed looses his/her natural weapons from Wrath of the Beast gaining -2 diff to seduction, first impression and leadership rolls instead.<br /> <br /> <b>Frailty</b><br /> Inspire the Jealous Heart: The formerly Accursed having finally cast of the bestial Curse are revealed to be the most gorgeous prince/princess there has ever been their full charisma unleashed and their passions their own again. Such transformation naturally inspires great jealousy amongst others. Should the Accursed love someone others will seek to either harm them, the relationship or take their place. Former enemies may become suitors and other Accursed may wish to see them dragged beneath the power of the Curse once more. Also having many interested suitors flocking them raises their friends and loved ones insecurities making it hard to fully trust the Accursed. The Accursed tend to be blinded by their own glory as well which often leads to their eventual downfall. The Accursed gain +2 diff. to Empathy rolls, inspire jealousy and possessiveness and affect mortals with Adoration as per the Autumn Sidhe Frailty.<br /> <br /> There you go. An Accursed non Dauntain Kith for you, or more like a skeleton of a Kith, to modify and fleshen up as you choose. This was a moments inspiration upon reading your post so it\u2019s likely not quite balanced and I may have made it a bit more complicated than it needs to be but perhaps it will inspire you to develop something of your own.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1629-possessed","name":"Possessed","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1629_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1140"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-01T19:35:01-07:00","id":1264187,"title":"","content":"Its a good start, I was mulling over whether it should be a kith proper or an add on..","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}